            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"美股｜美股活躍股交投熾熱 細價股成交稱冠\" class=\"rounded-lg\" height=\"502\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/e6cd3d35aab14a9b84d896addee28a7e5bc9c3f7f11e8c3427e591e579b8360d/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Ffortune_insight_694%2Fdbddec0f78d2a1ab4bc25a6950c04ffb.png\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">美股｜美股活躍股交投熾熱 細價股成交稱冠</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">美股2026年11月13日最活躍股份由細價股主導。SHF Holdings以5.0945億股成交量居首，收報0.0293美元，升0.0068美元。Z以1.90596億股排第二，收報0.32美元，升0.1092美元。英偉達成交1.20598億股，收報160.36美元，跌5.83美元。Rain Enhancement、Onfolio及Focus Universal亦打入前列，成交均逾5,800萬股。</p></div>",
